  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "The C. acnes KCOM 1861 was grown at 37°C on tryptic soy broth (TSB, Difco) medium supplemented with 0.5% yeast extract, 0.05% cysteine HCl-H2O, 0.5 mg/ml of hemin, 2 μg/ml of vitamin K1, and 5% sheep blood in anaerobic atmosphere (10% H2, 5% CO2, and 85% N2)."
    },
